  "abstract": "Covers the Open Cybersecurity Schema Framework at version 1.9.0, the version the OCSF schema server reports: categories, classes and activities, base attributes, the metadata object, profiles, extensions, unmapped data and validation against schema.ocsf.io, with a focus on mapping application audit logs. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out classes and activity IDs, attributes and objects, profiles and extensions, and validation with example events that pass the 1.9.0 validator.",
